  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A closed organ pipe of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>&nbsp;and an open organ pipe contain gases of densities <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;respectively. The compressibility of gases are equal in both the pipes. Both the pipes are vibrating in their first overtone with same frequency. The length of the open pipe is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>L</mi><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt></math>,&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is _______.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>(Round off to&nbsp;the Nearest Integer)</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9e34a638-3f19-4777-9bd2-b3dbfa3a0be5-image.png\" style=\"width: 161px; height: 168px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>L</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>L</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>L</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is bulk modulus)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>",
